) 2. c4
{ The Queen's Gambit. White offers the c4 pawn. If black takes, white can play e4 right away and will win the pawn back rather quickly. This gives white a lot of space if black takes. }
( 2. c4 { 3184 } ) 2... dxc4
{ If black takes, white can play e4 right away with pressure and will normally win the pawn back rather quickly. This does give white a lot of space. }
( 2... e6
